untry>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA EMIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YASUHARA, TORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, EMIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p> A bactericidal preparation containing peracetic acid as the main ingredient and comprising peracetic acid, at least one phosphate, and at least one nonionic surfactant.  The preparation is diluted to provide a practical fluid containing peracetic acid in a concentration capable of killing bacterial spores and acid-fast bacteria while keeping such a concentration for at least seven days.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une préparation bactéricide contenant de l'acide peracétique comme principal ingrédient, cette préparation renfermant également, outre l'acide peracétique, au moins un phosphate et au moins un tensioactif nonionique. Cette préparation est diluée de manière à produire un fluide pratique contenant de l'acide peracétique dans une concentration capable de tuer les spores bactériens ainsi que les bactéries acido-résistantes, ledit fluide conservant cette concentration pendant au moins sept jours.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>